      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "朝日杯FS……\n“朝日杯未来锦标”是聚集了\n新马级顶尖赛马娘的GⅠ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cdd0dbaedd820319e5d2598f76e7afbbb51a40e5b84999f851130bb6ab3e95f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
